---
output: svg, debug
expected-description: (Timing Diagram)
---
@startuml
robust "Web Browser" as WB
concise "Web User" as WU
binary "Enable" as EN

@0
WU is Idle
WB is Idle
EN is low

@100
WU is Waiting
WB is Processing
EN is high

@300 as :wait
WB is Waiting

@5000
WB is Idle
WU is Idle
EN is low

@5200
WU is Waiting

break :wait+100 to 4900
highlight 250 to 5100 #Gold : busy
WU -> WB@5000 : late
@enduml
